摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Android companion for DeepSeek Harness | chat, goals, approvals & notifications from your phone, over your LAN. Kotlin + Jetpack Compose.","id":"gh:1333842753","install_available":false,"language":"Kotlin","name":"deepseek-harness-mobile","slug":"sorsama/deepseek-harness-mobile","topics":["ai-agents","cordis","deepseek","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Android companion for DeepSeek Harness | chat, goals, approvals & notifications from your phone, ove"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"r your LAN. Kotlin + Jetpack Compose."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DSH Mobile"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"An Android app for driving a DeepSeek Harness from your phone."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English ·\n中文 ·\nहिन्दी ·\nEspañol ·\nFrançais ·\nไทย"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The DeepSeek Harness is an AI coding agent that runs on your computer and has a web interface.\nDSH M"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"obile connects to that harness and gives you the same controls in a native Android app. You can\nstar"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"t a task at your desk, then follow it, answer its questions and approve its commands from\nyour phone"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" a task at your desk, then follow it, answer its questions and approve its commands from\nyour phone."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"This is an unofficial, community-built app. It needs a harness running somewhere it can reach: on\nyo"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ur computer, or on the phone itself through Termux."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The project site has a one-page overview, and the\nwiki has the full user guide."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Connect | Chat | Trajectory | Details |\n|:--:|:--:|:--:|:--:|"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Paste the link the harness prints, and you are connected and signed in. | Replies stream in. Tool "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"calls fold into one row you can open. | Every tool call, turn by turn. | The session's model, contex"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"t, goal, plan mode and jobs. |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Subagents | Terminal | Sessions | Preview |\n|:--:|:--:|:--:|:--:|"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Read what a subagent did and send it a follow-up. | A real shell on the harness computer. | Group "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"sessions by project and drag them into your own order. | A README drawn the way GitHub draws it, on "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ct and drag them into your own order. | A README drawn the way GitHub draws it, on its own screen. |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Appearance | Color picker | Light theme | Dark theme |\n|:--:|:--:|:--:|:--:|"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Seven accent colors or any color you like, and haptics you can try. | Pick a color with the strip "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"and the area, or type a hex code. | Light, with a warm paper look. | Dark, or follow the system. |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## What you can do"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- Chat with the agent. Replies stream in with their reasoning, code blocks and tool calls. You\ncan a"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ttach photos and files, reference files with `@`, and run commands and skills with `/`.\n- Press and "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"hold a message, a tool call or a file to see what else you can do with it. Copy\nit, fix a message yo"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"u sent and send it again, or mention a file in your next message.\n- Answer what the agent needs from"},{"id":"p16s5","text":" you: approve or reject a command, answer its questions, and\nreview a plan before it starts.\n- Keep "},{"id":"p16s6","text":"an eye on long work. Goals, todo lists, queued messages, background jobs and subagents\neach have the"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"ir own view, and you can pause, steer or stop them.\n- Keep your sessions the way you like them. Drag"},{"id":"p16s8","text":" them into your own order, or group them by\nproject and fold the groups you are not using.\n- Find th"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"ings with one search field that works the same everywhere: sessions, models, commands,\nplugins, sche"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"duled tasks and workspace files.\n- Get a notification when a turn finishes, a goal completes or gets"},{"id":"p16s11","text":" blocked, or the agent is\nwaiting for an answer. The connection stays up in the background.\n- Browse"},{"id":"p16s12","text":" and preview the workspace files, and open a terminal on the harness computer.\n- Open files full scr"},{"id":"p16s13","text":"een in Preview: CSV tables, JSON trees, notebooks, PDFs, pictures, video,\naudio and archives, with f"},{"id":"p16s14","text":"ind in file. Save a copy puts any file on your phone.\n- Manage the harness itself: models, agent pre"},{"id":"p16s15","text":"sets, plugins, scheduled tasks and archived\nsessions.\n- Make it yours. The Ink design comes in light"},{"id":"p16s16","text":" and dark, with accent presets or a colour of your\nown, true black for OLED screens and a text size "},{"id":"p16s17","text":"you can change.\n- Use the app in English, Chinese, Hindi, Spanish, French, Arabic, Bengali, Portugue"},{"id":"p16s18","text":"se,\nRussian, Urdu or Thai. Right-to-left languages are supported."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The changelog lists what changed in each release."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Getting started"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 1. Install the app"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Download the APK from the latest release\nand install it. You need Android 8.0 or newer."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### 2. Make the harness reachable"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The harness only listens on its own computer by default. Pick the setup that matches where your\nphon"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"s only listens on its own computer by default. Pick the setup that matches where your\nphone will be."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"#### Same Wi-Fi as the computer"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Start the harness on the computer's local network address. On\nharness 0.2.1-alpha.2 and newer:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Use your computer's real address instead of `192.168.1.20`. The harness prints a line like\n`dsh web:"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" http://192.168.1.20:3080/?token=…`. In the app, choose **Local network**, paste that\nwhole link int"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"o the address field (or tap the paste button), and tap **Connect**. The token in the\nlink signs the "},{"id":"p26s4","text":"phone in, and the harness then appears under **Recent** for next time. Older harness\nversions need a"},{"id":"p26s5","text":" small patch instead of `--host`; see `harness/README.md`."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"#### Away from home"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Install dsh-relay, a\nharness plugin that adds a password, encryption and device pairing. Then choose"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" **Relay** in the\napp and scan the pairing QR code. The Relay wiki page\nwalks through it."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"#### USB cable or emulator"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Run `dsh web` on the computer and `adb reverse tcp:3080 tcp:3080`. In\nthe app, choose **This phone**"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" and sign in with the link `dsh web` printed."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"#### On the phone itself"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The harness can run in Termux.\nChoose **This phone**, and the app can start and stop the harness and"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" sign in for you. Setting up\nNode in Termux does not work on every device yet; read `harness/TERMUX."},{"id":"p32s3","text":"or you. Setting up\nNode in Termux does not work on every device yet; read `harness/TERMUX.md`\nfirst."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"#### Your own HTTPS reverse proxy"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Paste its `https://` address in **Local network** mode. The proxy\nencrypts the connection, but it do"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"es not check who is connecting. See\n`harness/README.md`."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Read docs/SECURITY.md before you connect over a network. A signed-in phone can\ndo anything the agent"},{"id":"p36s2","text":" can do, and the agent runs commands on your computer. Treat signing in like\ngiving out shell access"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"can do, and the agent runs commands on your computer. Treat signing in like\ngiving out shell access."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- Local network mode checks the sign-in token but does not encrypt anything. Use it only on a\nnetwor"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"k you trust.\n- Relay mode adds encryption and a pinned certificate, and works from outside your netw"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"ork.\n- Keep the `dsh web` link private. Anyone who has it can sign in until the harness restarts."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"DSH Mobile is tested against **DeepSeek Harness 0.2.2-rc.1**. Older harness versions back to\n0.1.6 s"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"till work for the most part, but newer features need a newer harness. The\ncompatibility table lists "},{"id":"p39s3","text":"which app version goes with which harness."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
